# Launcher-owned paths in this agent's control plane. `lock` is an flock and
# `running.md` records a pid, host and start time: machine-local, and meaningless in a
# clone. Committing `running.md` makes every clone report a crashed pass (S004) forever.
# Everything else under .iorisphere/ is this agent's durable memory and travels.
.iorisphere/lock
.iorisphere/running.md

# Tool-specific instruction files (Claude Code, Cline, GitHub Copilot)
CLAUDE.md
.clinerules/
.github/copilot-instructions.md
